#, c-format
msgid "%n important update available"
msgstr "%n pembaruan penting tersedia"

#, c-format
msgid "%n other update available"
msgstr "%n pembaruan lain tersedia"

#, c-format
msgid "%n update available"
msgstr "%n pembaruan tersedia"

msgid "No updates available."
msgstr "Tidak ada pembaruan yang tersedia."

msgid "&Configure"
msgstr "&Konfigurasi"

msgid "&Check for updates"
msgstr "&Periksa pembaruan"

msgid "Software Updates"
msgstr "Pembaruan Perangkat Lunak"

msgid "Reboot required"
msgstr "Perlu boot ulang"

msgid "System has installed important updates. Please reboot your computer as soon as possible to complete the upgrade."
msgstr "Sistem telah memasang pembaruan penting. Silakan mulai ulang komputer Anda sesegera mungkin untuk menyelesaikan peningkatan."

msgid "A reboot is required to complete the update. Reboot now? Any unsaved work will be lost."
msgstr "Diperlukan boot ulang untuk menyelesaikan pembaruan. Boot ulang sekarang? Pekerjaan yang belum disimpan akan hilang."

msgid "&Reboot now"
msgstr "&Boot ulang sekarang"

msgid "No updates available"
msgstr "Tidak ada pembaruan yang tersedia"

msgid "&Update now"
msgstr "&Perbarui sekarang"

msgid "Update Manager"
msgstr "Manajer Pembaruan"

msgid "Another instance of Update Manager is running, leaving ..."
msgstr "Instansi lain dari Manajer Pembaruan sedang berjalan, keluar ..."

msgid "Checking apt pinning"
msgstr "Memeriksa pin apt"

msgid "Ok"
msgstr "Oke"

msgid "need to be fixed"
msgstr "perlu diperbaiki"

msgid "Checking Internet connection"
msgstr "Memeriksa koneksi Internet"

msgid "Not available!"
msgstr "Tidak tersedia!"

msgid "Update SW database"
msgstr "Memperbarui basis data perangkat lunak"

msgid "Done"
msgstr "Selesai"

msgid "Failed"
msgstr "Gagal"

msgid "Listing updates"
msgstr "Membuat daftar pembaruan"

msgid "Checking apt database"
msgstr "Memeriksa basis data apt"

msgid "Fixing apt database"
msgstr "Memperbaiki basis data apt"

msgid "Downloading packages"
msgstr "Mengunduh paket"

msgid "Performing upgrade"
msgstr "Melakukan peningkatan"

msgid "Failed!"
msgstr "Gagal!"

msgid "Removing unnecessary packages"
msgstr "Menghapus paket yang tidak diperlukan"

msgid "Updating Flatpak applications"
msgstr "Memperbarui aplikasi Flatpak"

msgid "System update completed successfully."
msgstr "Pembaruan sistem berhasil diselesaikan."

msgid "Finished :)"
msgstr "Selesai :)"

msgid "Running Synaptic"
msgstr "Menjalankan Synaptic"

msgid "Synaptic package manager is not installed"
msgstr "Manajer paket Synaptic tidak terpasang"

msgid "using default updater instead"
msgstr "menggunakan pembaru bawaan sebagai gantinya"

msgid "Show details"
msgstr "Tampilkan rincian"

#, fuzzy
msgid "Hide details"
msgstr "Tampilkan rincian"

msgid "Cancel"
msgstr "Batal"

msgid "You are not allowed to perform system upgrades. You need to be member of administrative group \"sudo\" first, please contact system administrator."
msgstr "Anda tidak diizinkan untuk melakukan peningkatan sistem. Anda perlu menjadi anggota grup administratif \"sudo\" terlebih dahulu, silakan hubungi administrator sistem."

msgid "Checking permissions"
msgstr "Memeriksa izin"

msgid "Checking SW database to be free"
msgstr "Memeriksa basis data perangkat lunak agar bebas"

msgid "Locking SW database"
msgstr "Mengunci basis data perangkat lunak"

msgid "System updater has been started.."
msgstr "Pembaru sistem telah dimulai.."

msgid ""
"Package system is busy, not ready to install now. Setup cannot continue.\n"
"\n"
"The lock is caused, very probably, by ongoing background system updates. If this is the case, you have to wait a moment for package system to finish these operations.\n"
"\n"
"Please make sure you are not installing another application and repeat setup a few minutes later."
msgstr ""
"Sistem paket sedang sibuk, belum siap untuk memasang sekarang. Penyiapan tidak dapat dilanjutkan.\n"
"\n"
"Penguncian ini kemungkinan besar disebabkan oleh pembaruan sistem latar belakang yang sedang berlangsung. Jika demikian, Anda harus menunggu sebentar hingga sistem paket menyelesaikan operasi ini.\n"
"\n"
"Pastikan Anda tidak sedang memasang aplikasi lain dan ulangi penyiapan beberapa menit lagi."

msgid "Close"
msgstr "Tutup"

msgid ""
"Update manager has been exited with error code: %1.\n"
"\n"
"Please, try to run Update Manager a few minutes later again."
msgstr ""
"Manajer Pembaruan telah keluar dengan kode kesalahan: %1.\n"
"\n"
"Silakan coba jalankan Manajer Pembaruan lagi beberapa menit kemudian."

msgid "Available updates"
msgstr "Pembaruan yang tersedia"

msgid "Additional updates have been detected"
msgstr "Pembaruan tambahan telah terdeteksi"

msgid "Synaptic package manager is not installed so using default updater for now ..."
msgstr "Manajer paket Synaptic tidak terpasang sehingga untuk saat ini menggunakan pembaru bawaan ..."

msgid "Couldn't run Synaptic. Using default updater for now ..."
msgstr "Tidak dapat menjalankan Synaptic. Untuk saat ini menggunakan pembaru bawaan ..."

msgid "Closing.."
msgstr "Menutup.."

msgid "Success. The most recent update has been implemented. Reboot is required to complete the upgrade."
msgstr "Berhasil. Pembaruan terbaru telah diterapkan. Boot ulang diperlukan untuk menyelesaikan peningkatan."

msgid "Success. The most recent update has been implemented. Your system is up to date and healthy."
msgstr "Berhasil. Pembaruan terbaru telah diterapkan. Sistem Anda sudah mutakhir dan sehat."

msgid "Finish"
msgstr "Selesai"

msgid "Waiting"
msgstr "Menunggu"

msgid "Do you want to continue?"
msgstr "Apakah Anda ingin melanjutkan?"

msgid "Don't show this dialog again"
msgstr "Jangan tampilkan dialog ini lagi"

msgid ""
"If checked, next updates will be performed without user confirmation.\n"
"You can also configure update manager later."
msgstr ""
"Jika dicentang, pembaruan berikutnya akan dilakukan tanpa konfirmasi pengguna.\n"
"Anda juga dapat mengonfigurasi manajer pembaruan nanti."

msgid "No"
msgstr "Tidak"

msgid "Yes"
msgstr "Ya"

msgid "Canceled!"
msgstr "Dibatalkan!"

msgid ""
"System has received security fixes and important updates.\n"
"\n"
"Please Reboot your computer as soon as possible to complete the upgrade."
msgstr ""
"Sistem telah menerima perbaikan keamanan dan pembaruan penting.\n"
"\n"
"Silakan Boot Ulang komputer Anda sesegera mungkin untuk menyelesaikan peningkatan."

msgid "<p>Another instance of Update Manager is running, leaving ...<p>"
msgstr "<p>Instansi lain dari Manajer Pembaruan sedang berjalan, keluar ...<p>"

msgid "<p>You are not allowed to perform system upgrades. You need to be member of administrative group \"sudo\" first, please contact system administrator.</p>"
msgstr "<p>Anda tidak diizinkan untuk melakukan peningkatan sistem. Anda perlu menjadi anggota grup administratif \"sudo\" terlebih dahulu, silakan hubungi administrator sistem.</p>"

msgid "<p>Package system is busy, not ready to install now. Setup cannot continue.</p><p>The lock is caused, very probably, by ongoing background system updates. If this is the case, you have to wait a moment for package system to finish these operations.</p><p>Please make sure you are not installing another application and repeat setup a few minutes later.</p>"
msgstr "<p>Sistem paket sedang sibuk, belum siap untuk memasang sekarang. Penyiapan tidak dapat dilanjutkan.</p><p>Penguncian ini kemungkinan besar disebabkan oleh pembaruan sistem latar belakang yang sedang berlangsung. Jika demikian, Anda harus menunggu sebentar hingga sistem paket menyelesaikan operasi ini.</p><p>Pastikan Anda tidak sedang memasang aplikasi lain dan ulangi penyiapan beberapa menit lagi.</p>"

msgid "Canceled !"
msgstr "Dibatalkan !"

msgid "! Reboot required"
msgstr "! Perlu boot ulang"

msgid "<p>System has received security fixes and important updates.</p><p>Please <b>Reboot</b> your computer as soon as possible to complete the upgrade.</p>"
msgstr "<p>Sistem telah menerima perbaikan keamanan dan pembaruan penting.</p><p>Silakan <b>Boot Ulang</b> komputer Anda sesegera mungkin untuk menyelesaikan peningkatan.</p>"

msgid "Please, try to run Update Manager a few minutes later again."
msgstr "Silakan coba jalankan Manajer Pembaruan lagi beberapa menit kemudian."

msgid "Update manager has been exited with <b>error code: "
msgstr "Manajer Pembaruan telah keluar dengan <b>kode kesalahan: "

msgid "<b>Reboot is required<b> to complete the upgrade."
msgstr "<b>Diperlukan boot ulang<b> untuk menyelesaikan peningkatan."

msgid "Success. The most recent update has been implemented."
msgstr "Berhasil. Pembaruan terbaru telah diterapkan."

msgid "Your system is up to date and healthy."
msgstr "Sistem Anda sudah mutakhir dan sehat."

msgid "Finish >"
msgstr "Selesai >"

msgid "Do you want to continue ?"
msgstr "Apakah Anda ingin melanjutkan ?"

msgid "Installing.."
msgstr "Memasang.."

msgid "Q4OS Update Notifier"
msgstr "Pemberitahu Pembaruan Q4OS"

msgid "Q4OS Update Notifier for Trinity does not run under a Plasma desktop session. Please install the \"q4os-updater-plasma\" package to get update notifications here."
msgstr ""

#~ msgid "Please install \"q4os-updater-plasma\" package in order to get better experience."
#~ msgstr "Silakan pasang paket \"q4os-updater-plasma\" untuk mendapatkan pengalaman yang lebih baik."
